"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Can you check if the node's base class is AnimationMixer?","created_at":"2026-01-11T02:53:09Z","updated_at":"2026-01-11T02:53:10Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114844#discussion_r2679175639","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114844","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2679175639"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114844#discussion_r2679175639"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114844"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2679175639/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":1565,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":1571,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":12,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2682238371","pull_request_review_id":3650723784,"id":2682238371,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6f37Wj","diff_hunk":"@@ -1560,6 +1560,34 @@ Variant SceneState::get_property_value(int p_node, const StringName &p_property,\n \t\t\t\treturn variants[p[i].value];\n \t\t\t}\n \t\t}\n+\n+#ifndef DISABLE_DEPRECATED","path":"scene/resources/packed_scene.cpp","commit_id":"ccd664974ae10331824f5889fa6f3ca909fa421f","original_commit_id":"8c87e1ffd69c07241d5a02465ac6040227e8bb2b","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This should probably also be guarded with a `TOOLS_ENABLED` check, as this is not relevant at runtime IINM, and this would have some performance cost for the string conversion and check every time a value is read.\r\n\r\nGiven the above, I also wonder if this isn't something  that could be handled in `AnimationMixer` via `_set`/`_get` instead of doing it here?","created_at":"2026-01-12T13:17:24Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T13:17:25Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114844#discussion_r2682238371","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114844","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2682238371"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114844#discussion_r2682238371"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114844"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2682238371/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1564,"original_line":1564,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":5,"position":5,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2683426457","pull_request_review_id":3652145219,"id":2683426457,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6f8daZ","diff_hunk":"@@ -1560,6 +1560,34 @@ Variant SceneState::get_property_value(int p_node, const StringName &p_property,\n \t\t\t\treturn variants[p[i].value];\n \t\t\t}\n \t\t}\n+\n+#ifndef DISABLE_DEPRECATED","path":"scene/resources/packed_scene.cpp","commit_id":"ccd664974ae10331824f5889fa6f3ca909fa421f","original_commit_id":"8c87e1ffd69c07241d5a02465ac6040227e8bb2b","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The code within this block should indicate that it is attempting to retrieve `libraries/xxxxx` from a scene that does not have the `libraries/xxxxx`.\r\n\r\nIn 4.6, setters and getters already perform serialization assuming the `libraries/xxxxx` path.\r\n\r\nAs compatibility code, the setter is written to parse dictionaries passed with the `libraries` path. However, enabling the getter to retrieve dictionaries with the `libraries` path, as shown below, does not resolve this issue.\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nbool AnimationMixer::_get(const StringName &p_name, Variant &r_ret) const {\r\n\tString name = p_name;\r\n\r\n#ifndef DISABLE_DEPRECATED\r\n#ifdef TOOLS_ENABLED\r\n\tif (name == \"libraries\") {\r\n\t\tr_ret = get_animation_libraries();\r\n\t} else if (name.begins_with(\"libraries/\")) {\r\n#endif // TOOLS_ENABLED\r\n#else\r\n\tif (name.begins_with(\"libraries/\")) {\r\n#endif // DISABLE_DEPRECATED\r\n\t\tString which = name.get_slicec('/', 1);\r\n\t\tif (has_animation_library(which)) {\r\n\t\t\tr_ret = get_animation_library(which);\r\n\t\t} else {\r\n\t\t\treturn false;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t} else {\r\n\t\treturn false;\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\treturn true;\r\n}\r\n\r\n#ifndef DISABLE_DEPRECATED\r\n#ifdef TOOLS_ENABLED\r\nDictionary AnimationMixer::get_animation_libraries() const {\r\n\tDictionary ret;\r\n\tfor (const AnimationLibraryData &lib : animation_libraries) {\r\n\t\tDictionary d;\r\n\t\tList<StringName> ls;\r\n\t\tlib.library->get_animation_list(&ls);\r\n\t\tfor (const StringName &an : ls) {\r\n\t\t\td[an] = lib.library->get_animation(an);\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\tret[lib.name] = d;\r\n\t}\r\n\treturn ret;\r\n}\r\n#endif // TOOLS_ENABLED\r\n#endif // DISABLE_DEPRECATED\r\n```\r\n\r\n(BTW, `get_animation_libraries()` was a dead definition, so I sent a fix as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114897.)\r\n\r\nTherefore, I don't think there's any other way.\r\n\r\nAdding `TOOLS_ENABLED` makes point. If reducing string comparison cost is a consideration, I think increasing the `gd_scene format` in `4.6` might allow checks to be performed only on tscn versions prior to `4.5` by integer comparison (but I'm not sure increasing format version is approved as it is not within my area to decide that).","created_at":"2026-01-12T18:32:30Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T19:04:49Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114844#discussion_r2683426457","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114844","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2683426457"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114844#discussion_r2683426457"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114844"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2683426457/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1564,"original_line":1564,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2682238371,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":5,"position":5,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2684614044","pull_request_review_id":3653552625,"id":2684614044,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6gA_Wc","diff_hunk":"@@ -1560,6 +1560,34 @@ Variant SceneState::get_property_value(int p_node, const StringName &p_property,\n \t\t\t\treturn variants[p[i].value];\n \t\t\t}\n \t\t}\n+\n+#ifndef DISABLE_DEPRECATED","path":"scene/resources/packed_scene.cpp","commit_id":"ccd664974ae10331824f5889fa6f3ca909fa421f","original_commit_id":"8c87e1ffd69c07241d5a02465ac6040227e8bb2b","user":{"login":"Clubhouse1661","id":177586398,"node_id":"U_kgDOCpXA3g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177586398?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661","html_url":"https://github.com/Clubhouse1661","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"bo