aries\";","path":"scene/resources/packed_scene.cpp","commit_id":"1d22d72a053fe3f893c543ff5382e3e8bcb1a4fd","original_commit_id":"1d22d72a053fe3f893c543ff5382e3e8bcb1a4fd","user":{"login":"Clubhouse1661","id":177586398,"node_id":"U_kgDOCpXA3g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177586398?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661","html_url":"https://github.com/Clubhouse1661","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"```cpp\r\nStringName node_type = get_node_type(p_node);\r\n\t\t\tif (node_type != StringName() && ClassDB::is_parent_class(node_type, SNAME(\"AnimationMixer\"))) {\r\n```\r\nGood catch. I've added the check to ensure the node's base class is AnimationMixer before applying the backwards compatibility logic.","created_at":"2026-01-13T02:50:51Z","updated_at":"2026-01-13T02:50:51Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114844#discussion_r2684617897","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114844","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2684617897"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114844#discussion_r2684617897"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114844"}},"